  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Energetic Reactor</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190313010717\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Captain Atom Anti-Magic\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190313010717\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190313010717 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20190313010717 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Captain Atom Anti-Magic\" width=\"270\" height=\"417\" data-image-key=\"Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Captain Atom Anti-Magic.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Nathaniel Adams/Captain Atom (DC Comics) can draw power from the Quantum Field to strengthen himself and fuel his nuclear powers.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb energy and convert to nuclear reactions</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>absorb energy and convert it towards nuclear reactions</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Manipulation\">Nuclear Manipulation</a>. Opposite of <a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Conversion\" title=\"Nuclear Conversion\">Nuclear Conversion</a>\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Reactor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Energetic Nuclear Reaction</li>\n<li>Nuclear Capacitance</li>\n<li>Transduction Fission</li>\n<li>Transduction Fusion</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Reactor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb energy and convert it towards self-generated nuclear reactions. They are capable of creating nuclear substances, energies from themselves and around them without issue. They are also capable of manipulating personal nuclear forces. Unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a>, this power relies on external forces for their atomic abilities.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Reactor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Activation_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Activation Manipulation\">Bio-Activation Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Chemical_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Chemical Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Chemical Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nucleochemistry_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nucleochemistry Manipulation\">Bio-Nucleochemistry Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Generation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Generation\">Bio-Nuclear Generation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fission_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fission Manipulation\">Bio-Fission Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electroweak_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Electroweak Manipulation\">Bio-Electroweak Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Topology_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Topology Manipulation\">Bio-Topology Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fusion_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fusion Manipulation\">Bio-Fusion Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Atomic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Atomic Manipulation\">Bio-Atomic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Matter Manipulation\">Bio-Matter Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quark_Manipulation\" title=\"Quark Manipulation\">Quark Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Particle_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Particle Manipulation\">Bio-Particle Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Bang_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Bang Manipulation\">Bio-Bang Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Quantum_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Quantum Manipulation\">Bio-Quantum Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Manipulation\">Bio-Cosmic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Subatomic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Subatomic Manipulation\">Bio-Subatomic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatility_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Volatility Manipulation\">Bio-Volatility Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Manipulation\">Nuclear Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Dynamo\">Bio-Nuclear Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Activation_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Activation Dynamo\">Bio-Activation Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatile_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Volatile Dynamo\">Bio-Volatile Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Combustion\" title=\"Energetic Combustion\">Energetic Combustion</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Reactive_Perpetuator\" title=\"Bio-Reactive Perpetuator\">Bio-Reactive Perpetuator</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Radiation\" title=\"Energetic Radiation\">Energetic Radiation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Dynamo\">Bio-Ionic Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Ionization\" title=\"Energetic Ionization\">Energetic Ionization</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Detection\" title=\"Energy Detection\">Energy Detection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Energy\">Personal Energy</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Concentration\" title=\"Nuclear Concentration\">Nuclear Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Activation_Energy\" title=\"Personal Activation Energy\">Personal Activation Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Energy\">Personal Energy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Strong_Force\" title=\"Personal Strong Force\">Personal Strong Force</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Fire\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Fire\">Personal Nuclear Fire</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Atomic_Manipulation\" title=\"Self-Atomic Manipulation\">Self-Atomic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Weak_Force\" title=\"Personal Weak Force\">Personal Weak Force</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Radiation\">Personal Radiation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Reactor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Mimicry\" title=\"Nuclear Mimicry\">Nuclear Mimicry</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Mimicry\" title=\"Ionic Mimicry\">Ionic Mimicry</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Reactor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radio-Nuclear_Dynamo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Radio-Nuclear Dynamo\">Radio-Nuclear Dynamo</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Reactor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitance_Manipulation\" title=\"Capacitance Manipulation\">Capacitance Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Manipulation\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation\">Elemental Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Sourcing\" title=\"Energy Sourcing\">Energy Sourcing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Conversion\" title=\"Life-Force Conversion\">Life-Force Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Manipulation\">Nuclear Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Reactor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much energy user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in areas with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Reactor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Prypiatosian-B\">Prypiatosian-Bs</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Captain_Atom\">Nathaniel Adams/Captain Atom</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Firestorm\">Firestorm</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)\n<ul><li>Ronny Raymond</li>\n<li>Jason Rusch</li>\n<li>Martin Stein</li></ul></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Major_Force\">Clifford Zmeck/Major Force</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://fma.fandom.com/wiki/Father\">Father</a> (<i>Full Metal Alchemist</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Galan_(Earth-616)\">Galan/Galactus</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260731044238\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 155/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 169/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.814      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    8.814      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:448784-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260731044238 and revision id 2853067. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
